      "docs": [
        "Minimum-output reference for a `VerifiedCpi`'s post-fee balance-diff gate."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "enum",
        "variants": [
          {
            "name": "SignedQuote",
            "fields": [
              {
                "name": "quoter",
                "type": "pubkey"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "Oracle",
            "fields": [
              {
                "name": "feed",
                "type": "pubkey"
              },
              {
                "name": "max_slippage_bps",
                "type": "u16"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "SlotRole",
      "type": {
        "kind": "enum",
        "variants": [
          {
            "name": "Fixed",
            "fields": [
              {
                "defined": {
                  "name": "FixedRole"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "Free"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "SolanaAction",
      "docs": [
        "A pre-registered action to execute on the destination chain after fill",
        "finalization. v1: `SplTransfer` (static, exact-match accounts) and",
        "`VerifiedCpi` (dynamic accounts, outcome-verified)."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "enum",
        "variants": [
          {
            "name": "SplTransfer",
            "fields": [
              {
                "name": "recipient",
                "type": "pubkey"
              },
              {
                "name": "amount_bps",
                "docs": [
                  "Basis points of the execution vault balance to transfer (e.g., 10000 = 100%)."
                ],
                "type": "u16"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "VerifiedCpi",
            "fields": [
              {
                "name": "program_id",
                "docs": [
                  "Pinned program — checked loader-owned-executable + exact pubkey at execution."
                ],
                "type": "pubkey"
              },
              {
                "name": "input_mint",
                "docs": [
                  "Token spent from the vault (usually `expected_mint`)."
                ],
                "type": "pubkey"
              },
              {
                "name": "input_bps",
                "docs": [
                  "Basis points of the vault moved into the scratch source — the input bound."
                ],
                "type": "u16"
              },
              {
                "name": "account_template",
                "type": {
                  "defined": {
                    "name": "AccountTemplate"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "output_mint",
                "docs": [
                  "Fungible receipt the engine balance-diffs (swap output, vault share, LST, …)."
                ],
                "type": "pubkey"
              },
              {
                "name": "min_out",
                "type": {
                  "defined": {
                    "name": "MinOut"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "allow_permissioned_output",
                "docs": [
                  "Opt-in for Token-2022 permissioned (perm-delegate / frozen) output mints."
                ],
                "type": "bool"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "SolanaSraRoute",
      "docs": [
        "Deterministic destination address for EVM->Solana fills.",
        "PDA seeds: [\"sra_route\", owner, config_hash, salt]",
        "config_hash = keccak256(borsh(owner, source_chain_id, expected_mint, action_config))"
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "owner",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "source_chain_id",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "expected_mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "action_config",
            "docs": [
              "The committed action list, stored typed so later instructions read it",
              "directly instead of re-verifying a relayer-supplied copy. Also folded into",
              "the route's config_hash (the PDA seed), so the address inherently commits",
              "to it."
            ],
            "type": {
              "vec": {
                "defined": {
                  "name": "SolanaAction"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "salt",
            "type": {
              "array": [
                "u8",
                32
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "allowed_adapters",
            "type": {
              "vec": "pubkey"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "allowed_executors",
            "docs": [
              "Owner-managed; not in `route_config_hash` (mutable, like `allowed_adapters`).",
              "Empty = no caller can `execute_actions`."
            ],
            "type": {
              "vec": "pubkey"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "paused",
            "type": "bool"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "SourceHandlerData",
      "docs": [
        "Owner-installed source policy. Stored in the SRA and committed at install",
        "via `handler_data_hash`, which is folded into the SRA's PDA identity. The",
        "routing tuple",
        "(`target_chain_id` / `recipient` / `target_token`) is part of the immutable",
        "identity, mirroring the EVM `RouteConfig` that `trigger()` reads from",
        "storage and a caller cannot redirect. Every deposit must echo this exact",
        "routing in `PrepareParams`; `trigger` rejects any divergence."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "address_book_root",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "target_chain_id",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "recipient",
            "type": {
              "array": [
                "u8",
                32
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "target_token",
            "type": {
              "array": [
                "u8",
                32
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "allowed_slippage_bps",
            "type": "u16"
          },
          {
            "name": "allowed_adapters",
            "type": {
              "vec": "pubkey"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "SraConfig",
      "docs": [
        "One source-side SRA per `(owner, final_handler, handler_data_hash, salt)`.",
        "PDA seeds: [\"sra\", owner, config_hash, salt]",
        "config_hash = keccak256(owner ‖ final_handler ‖ handler_data_hash)"
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "owner",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "final_handler",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "handler_data",
            "type": {
              "defined": {
                "name": "SourceHandlerData"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "salt",
            "type": {
              "array": [
                "u8",
                32
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "initiator",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "active",
            "type": "bool"
          },
          {
            "name": "deposit_nonce",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "VerifiedFill",
      "docs": [
        "Adapter-owned verification artifact. Created by this adapter once it has",
        "confirmed a CCTP mint, then read by the handler across the program boundary",
        "to authorize `finalize_fill`. A vault-balance increase alone cannot prove a",
        "legitimate bridge fill — this account is the trust boundary that does.",
        "",
        "The struct name must stay `VerifiedFill`: the handler hardcodes",
        "`sha256(\"account:VerifiedFill\")[..8]` as the discriminator it accepts from",
        "every adapter.",
        "",
        "The post-discriminator field layout is a cross-program ABI contract with",
        "`sra_common::types::VerifiedFillData`. The handler reads this account as raw bytes",
        "(it must accept fills from multiple adapter programs, each with its own",
        "program id, so it cannot import this type) and deserializes via that plain",
        "struct, requiring an exact layout match. Any field reorder, addition, or",
        "removal here is a breaking change and MUST be mirrored there — the round-trip",
        "and discriminator tests below fail loudly if the two drift."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "adapter",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "route",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "fill_id",
            "type": {
              "array": [
                "u8",
                32
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "mint",
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "amount",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "expected_amount",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "source_chain_id",
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "created_at",
            "type": "i64"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}